The '''Supreme Timecharm''' is a {{Special}} [[Rift Timecharms|Rift Timecharm]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |A1 = Bottled Odonata     |B1 = Lil' Pad, 16              |C1 = Bottled Odonata
 |A2 = Deadgehog Spine, 12 |B2 = Leech Supreme Fragment, 4 |C2 = Deadgehog Spine, 12
 |A3 = Bottled Odonata     |B3 = Lil' Pad, 16              |C3 = Bottled Odonata
 |Output = Supreme Timecharm
 }}
}}

== Usage ==
The player can bring a '''Supreme Timecharm''' to {{NPCSprite|Elise (Rift)}} in the {{zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}} to grant access to the {{zone|Rift Gallery}}, where they can secure the [[Rift Timecharms|Timecharm]]. Securing the '''Supreme Timecharm''' grants {{SkyBlock XP|+100}} and unlocks the {{zone|West Village}} and thus all of the following locations:
*{{zone|Dolphin Trainer}}
*{{zone|Dreadfarm}}
*{{zone|Great Beanstalk}}
*{{zone|Infested House}}
*{{zone|Mirrorverse}}

=== Game Message ===
Securing the '''Supreme Timecharm''' will result in the following message, which will be broadcast to the entire lobby:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&d&lRIFTASTIC! &7[player] &ehas secured &cSupreme Timecharm&e into their gallery! &6gg&e!}}}}
=== Rift Necklace ===
{{Main|Rift Necklace}}
Securing the '''Supreme Timecharm''' will add additional [[stats]] to the [[Rift Necklace]] both inside and outside the [[Rift Dimension]].

